# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfvars
**/tfplan
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.backup

# Week subdirectory .github folders (workflows live at repo root)
week-*/.github/

# Blog HTML files (kept locally only)
**/docs/blog/*.html
**/docs/blog/BLOG_BLOGGER.html
# Legacy paths (pre-restructure)
week-*/blog/*.html
week-*/blog/BLOG_BLOGGER.html

# Lambda build artifacts (generated by Terraform archive_file — never commit zips)
**/lambda/builds/
**/lambda_layer/
**/*.zip

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Local study and prep docs (not for GitHub)
**/docs/explainer.md
**/docs/blog-prep.md
**/docs/commands.md
**/docs/screenshots.md
# Legacy paths (pre-restructure)
**/EXPLAINER.md
**/BLOG_PREP.md
**/README-with-screenshots.md
**/COMMANDS.md
**/SCREENSHOTS.md

# Blog screenshots (large files, kept locally)
**/docs/blog/screenshots/
**/blog/screenshots/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
